277
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:44,320
No, I said something that I'd regret.

278
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:48,180
All right, look, I am sorry that I was rude.

279
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:49,820
I admit that I was thoughtless.

280
00:14:50,300 --> 00:14:51,860
I admit I got a little carried away.

281
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:57,720
Oh, honey, it's okay, because I know how frustrating it must be to deal with someone

282
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,360
